@startuml sm-submission
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #EFF6FF
  BorderColor #1D4ED8
  FontColor #0F172A
}
title State Machine — Submission Intake & Attribution (MF-02)
left to right direction
[*] --> ACCEPTED : Candidate self-applies (Application created)
[*] --> PENDING_CONSENT : Affiliate refers candidate
[*] --> BLOCKED_DUPLICATE : Duplicate candidate in job
PENDING_CONSENT --> ACCEPTED : Candidate confirms consent
PENDING_CONSENT --> PENDING_IDENTITY_REVIEW : Same-job duplicate case
PENDING_IDENTITY_REVIEW --> ACCEPTED : Duplicate case resolved (accepted)
PENDING_CONSENT --> CONSENT_REJECTED : Declines / reports unauthorized
PENDING_CONSENT --> CONSENT_EXPIRED : Consent window expired (48h)
PENDING_CONSENT --> CANCELLED : Cancelled before consent
ACCEPTED --> [*]
CONSENT_REJECTED --> [*]
CONSENT_EXPIRED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]
BLOCKED_DUPLICATE --> [*]
@enduml
